  "body": "Add the BenchExec tool-info module for ikos-conc, a sound static data-race detector for concurrent C programs (SV-COMP 2027, C.no-data-race).\r\n\r\nThe module runs the bundled svcomp_witness.py wrapper (demote + BMC re-confirmation), forwards the task's ILP32/LP64 data model, and maps the verdict line to TRUE / FALSE(no-data-race) / UNKNOWN.\r\n\r\nTool info: https://github.com/2393591260/ikos-conc",
